# ==========================================
# Design Canvas (Claude Design)
# ==========================================
# The .dc.html artboards and canvas.json are the source and ARE tracked.
# The seeded bundle is ~2.5 MB of generated editor payload — regenerate it
# from the artboards instead of committing it.
docs/design/*-screens.html

